":null,"explanation":"<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Aldehydes, Ketones and Carboxylic Acids Question 5 Hindi Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkhtr/0f42e693-9945-4fb4-9505-91c289c33676/1f25acf0-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkhts.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>ये समान आण्विक सूत्र और भिन्न ऐल्किल प्रतिस्थापियों वाले मध्यावयवी (metamers) हैं।</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/i